        </h2>
        <div class="details" id="faq-4-details" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-4-button" hidden>
          <p>Yes. Indoor cats benefit from scratching posts, climbing surfaces, window perches, puzzle feeders, and interactive play. Enrichment helps prevent boredom, supports exercise, and reduces unwanted behaviors.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example">
        <h2 class="question">
          <button class="toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-5-details" id="faq-5-button">
